325
00:43:03,380 --> 00:43:05,380
AVP Narration: made a heavy impact in many countries

326
00:43:05,380 --> 00:43:06,420
AVP Narration: including the Philippines.

327
00:43:06,740 --> 00:43:07,540
AVP Narration: Under uplift,

328
