AVP Narration: the DOTR and its attached agencies

329
00:43:09,920 --> 00:43:12,340
AVP Narration: implemented recalibrated support packages

330
00:43:12,340 --> 00:43:13,980
AVP Narration: that include fair discounts,

331
00:43:14,080 --> 00:43:15,080
AVP Narration: free rides,

332
00:43:15,080 --> 00:43:16,380
