333
00:43:16,380 --> 00:43:17,920
AVP Narration: terminal fee discount,

334
00:43:17,920 --> 00:43:19,080
AVP Narration: call discount,

335
00:43:19,080 --> 00:43:21,080
AVP Narration: rebate and transport charges,

336
00:43:21,080 --> 00:43:22,840
AVP Narration: and service contracting program

337
00:43:22,840 --> 00:43:23,840
AVP Narration: among others.

338
00:43:23,840 --> 00:43:25,080
AVP Narration: All this to caution

339
00:43:25,080 --> 00:43:27,080
