346
00:43:39,580 --> 00:43:42,080
AVP Narration: in Paranaque Integrated Terminal Exchange.

347
00:43:42,080 --> 00:43:43,960
AVP Narration: The DOTR likewise continues to improve

348
00:43:43,960 --> 00:43:45,960
AVP Narration: to implement a 50% fair discount

349
00:43:45,960 --> 00:43:48,960
AVP Narration: to all passengers with MRT3 and LRT2.

350
00:43:48,960 --> 00:43:53,040
AVP Narration: In the railway sector,

