377
00:44:50,040 --> 00:44:53,040
AVP Narration: Clark-Pampanga and Calamba, Laguna

378
00:44:53,040 --> 00:44:55,040
AVP Narration: from over 4 hours to just 2 hours.

379
00:44:55,040 --> 00:44:58,040
AVP Narration: Preparations for the NSCR's operations and maintenance

380
00:44:58,040 --> 00:44:59,040
AVP Narration: are underway.

381
00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:04,200
AVP Narration: with the public-private partnership market sounding activities being held in different countries.

382
00:45:04,500 --> 00:45:11,960
