DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ay wag na, advice na po nila, abisuhan na po nila.

617
01:04:56,250 --> 01:05:01,710
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang ating motorista na to take alternative routes and don't take the expressway.

618
