Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Salamat, Mr. Chair, Ginong Sekretary.

620
01:05:15,950 --> 01:05:24,610
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kasi po yung North Luzon Expressway naging North Luzon Express Lake, di po ba, kaya po, libo-libo mga kababayan natin nabimbin po doon.

621
01:05:24,610 --> 01:05:32,270
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ang hindi po natin maintindihan, naging parking lot na po yung NLEX, pero tuloy pa rin yung pang-kolekta ng toll fees.

622
01:05:32,410 --> 01:05:37,010
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Bakit po nagkaroon ng delay doon sa paghinto ng pagkolekta ng toll fees?

623
01:05:37,130 --> 01:05:42,890
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Bakit po it took them more than 24 hours para po isuspend ang collection, Mr. Sekretary?

624
01:05:43,150 --> 01:05:43,650
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Chair?

625
01:05:44,470 --> 01:05:52,230
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang nangyari po dito, naayon din po naman ito sa STOA natin, Toll Operations Agreement.

626
01:05:52,230 --> 01:05:54,230
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: If we're going to impose, sabihin natin,

627
01:05:54,610 --> 01:06:00,230
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: suspension of toll collection, kailangan po merong may proseso.

628
01:06:00,830 --> 01:06:08,010
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Dito po yung mga nasama na po sa sabihin natin yung mga na-pervision na po noong August 31 and everything.

629
01:06:08,230 --> 01:06:10,830
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Hindi na po nila kailangan ng toll holiday.

630
01:06:11,210 --> 01:06:14,090
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: What is needed is more of toll reimbursement po.

631
01:06:15,370 --> 01:06:23,050
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yesterday po, habang inaantay pa namin yung kasagutan ng NLEX dito sa notice to explain natin,

632
01:06:23,230 --> 01:06:24,590
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: kami naman po nag-uusapin.

633
01:06:24,610 --> 01:06:26,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Nag-uusap ng NLEX management.

634
01:06:27,450 --> 01:06:34,470
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At kaya nga po, napagkasunduan namin na bumibigay kami ng toll holiday hanggang maayos itong problema.

635
