DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Hindi po yun ang ibig sabihin.

638
01:06:42,530 --> 01:06:46,350
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: We just appeal to their corporate social responsibility.

639
01:06:46,830 --> 01:06:48,610
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang kailangan po kasi namin makita dito,

640
01:06:48,610 --> 01:06:50,310
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ano ba talaga ang sanhi?

641
01:06:50,890 --> 01:06:53,910
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Bakit nagkaganito ang problema, ang trabiko?

642
01:06:54,610 --> 01:06:58,070
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Baka nagkulang sila sa public information campaign.

643
01:06:58,870 --> 01:07:01,270
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasama po dapat yan sa obligasyon nila.

644
01:07:01,590 --> 01:07:04,530
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero yung pagbabaha po ng toll expressway,

645
01:07:04,750 --> 01:07:08,390
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: kailangang tingnan kapag sila ba'y sumunod sa disenyo ng expressway.

646
01:07:08,850 --> 01:07:10,310
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kapag sila ba'y sumunod,

647
01:07:10,390 --> 01:07:14,230
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: baka po talaga ang sadya ng sanhi ng kanilang pagbaha,

648
01:07:14,530 --> 01:07:16,910
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ay hindi po dahil mali ang kanilang disenyo.

649
01:07:17,330 --> 01:07:22,490
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero ang alam ko po, may pagkukulang how to inform the public kaya na perwisyo.

650
01:07:22,490 --> 01:07:24,410
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Parang ngayon po, for example,

651
01:07:24,610 --> 01:07:29,610
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: alam nila na mahaba yung traffic pero meron po tayong mga motorista pa rin

652
01:07:29,610 --> 01:07:31,610
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: na ginagamit yung expressway natin.

653
01:07:31,610 --> 01:07:35,610
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: We understand na they would rather take the expressway

654
01:07:35,610 --> 01:07:39,610
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: than take the alternative routes inside kasi baha din po.

655
01:07:39,610 --> 01:07:41,610
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So ito na lang po yung naiiwan na option.

656
01:07:41,610 --> 01:07:45,610
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kaya minabuti na rin po namin nakiusap sa NLEX management.

657
01:07:45,610 --> 01:07:54,610
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kung maaari, itol free natin yung segment ng Pulilan hanggang San Fernando and vice versa.

658
01:07:54,610 --> 01:07:56,610
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Northbound and southbound.

659
01:07:56,610 --> 01:08:03,610
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: By the way, Mr. Chairman, andito po yung spokesperson ng NLEX.

660
01:08:03,610 --> 01:08:08,610
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So isa po yung sa pinakaiusap din natin ay magbigay ng tubig sa mga na perwisyo sa traffic

661
01:08:08,610 --> 01:08:10,610
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: to put portalette also.

662
01:08:10,610 --> 01:08:14,610
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So yun po yung mga ginawa nating mga immediate measures

663
01:08:14,610 --> 01:08:20,610
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: para kahit papaano po yung mga na perwisyo ay mabigyan din natin ng konting solusyon.

664
01:08:22,990 --> 01:08:23,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Salamat, Mr. Chair.

665
01:08:23,990 --> 01:08:24,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At salamat po ang ginawa ng sekretary.

666
01:08:24,990 --> 01:08:27,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Punta naman po tayo sa usapin ng EDSA bus carousel.

667
01:08:27,990 --> 01:08:33,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: 60 million po ang ridership ng EDSA carousel noong 2024 at 2025.

668
01:08:33,990 --> 01:08:39,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Napakalaking tulong po natin ito sa mga kababayan nating nakikibaka araw-araw sa commute sa EDSA.

669
01:08:39,990 --> 01:08:42,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At yung pakikibaka po na sinasabi ko hindi siya understatement.

670
01:08:42,990 --> 01:08:46,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Yan po talaga ang laban ng mga commuters sa EDSA everyday

671
01:08:46,990 --> 01:08:50,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: para po makapasok sa trabaho at makauwi sa kanila pong mga mahal sa buhay.

672
01:08:50,990 --> 01:08:53,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kaya nga po ang laking pagtatakak po natin

673
01:08:53,990 --> 01:08:56,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: na masilip natin ang budget ng DOTR.

674
01:08:56,990 --> 01:09:04,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Bakit po zero ang budget ng EDSA busway service contracting at fuel subsidy program for 2027?

675
01:09:06,990 --> 01:09:08,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama po. Salamat po.

676
01:09:08,990 --> 01:09:11,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Before I answer that po, Mr. Chairman.

677
01:09:11,990 --> 01:09:13,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kaya nga po kami nandirito.

678
01:09:13,990 --> 01:09:16,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi talagang kami nagpapasalamat din po sa Kongreso.

679
01:09:16,990 --> 01:09:17,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Doon sa foresight ninyo.

680
01:09:17,990 --> 01:09:18,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: For example po.

681
01:09:18,990 --> 01:09:20,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Last year, wala rin po kami.

682
01:09:20,990 --> 01:09:22,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Wala pong binigay sa NEP namin

683
01:09:22,990 --> 01:09:23,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ang

684
01:09:23,990 --> 01:09:28,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: service contracting ng EDSA Bus Carousel, ng PTMP.

685
01:09:28,990 --> 01:09:34,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero minabuti po ng Kongreso na bigyan kami ng pondo dito sa mga ganitong programa.

686
01:09:34,990 --> 01:09:37,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At ang nangyari po because of oil crisis.

687
01:09:37,990 --> 01:09:39,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung foresight po ninyo.

688
01:09:39,990 --> 01:09:41,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Nagamit namin yung service contracting.

689
01:09:41,990 --> 01:09:44,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Nagamit namin yung mga programang nilaan ninyo ng pondo.

690
01:09:44,990 --> 01:09:49,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ganito din po ang sitwasyon namin sa EDSA bus carousel.

691
01:09:49,990 --> 01:09:50,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: No.

692
01:09:50,990 --> 01:09:52,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang dati-dati po ang sinasabi po nila.

693
01:09:52,990 --> 01:09:58,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang maaaring rason kung bakit hindi kami nabibigyan ng tamang budget sa aming inihingi.

694
01:09:58,990 --> 01:10:01,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ay una yung limited fiscal space.

695
01:10:01,990 --> 01:10:02,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama po yun.

696
01:10:02,990 --> 01:10:08,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pangalawa sabi po nila baka po yung obligation rate po namin at yung BOR.

697
01:10:08,990 --> 01:10:09,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama din po yun.

698
01:10:09,990 --> 01:10:15,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kaya ngayon po naman pinakita po namin na as of July 2026.

699
01:10:15,990 --> 01:10:18,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang obligation rate na po ng DOTR.

700
01:10:18,990 --> 01:10:19,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Is 82%.

701
01:10:19,990 --> 01:10:21,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Is 82.6%.

702
01:10:21,990 --> 01:10:26,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: The disbursement rate is around 52%.

703
01:10:26,990 --> 01:10:32,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So mapakikita naman natin na yung yung rason na yun ay talagang sinusolusyonan namin at tinutuganan.

704
01:10:32,990 --> 01:10:36,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kaya kung ano man yung ang nakikita lang namin na sanhi.

705
01:10:36,990 --> 01:10:38,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kung bakit hindi kami nabigyan.

706
01:10:38,990 --> 01:10:42,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ay siguro po yung limited fiscal space na lang po ng ating gobyerno.

707
01:10:42,990 --> 01:10:46,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Hindi na po dahil may kakulangan ang DOTR.

708
01:10:46,990 --> 01:10:48,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So para malinaw lang po Mr. Secretary.

709
01:10:48,990 --> 01:10:57,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sinusuportahan niyo po ang ating panawagan na dapat ay i-restore yung funding para sa EDSA Busway Carousel ngayon pong 2027 budget.

710
01:10:57,990 --> 01:11:00,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: We are with you Mr. Chairman, Your Honor.

711
01:11:00,990 --> 01:11:01,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you Mr. Chair.

712
01:11:01,990 --> 01:11:06,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Marami po sa mga tao sa kwalitong ito may sariling kotse at private vehicles.

713
01:11:06,990 --> 01:11:10,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pero wag po tayong magkakamali sa privilege na ito ang realidad sa labas.

714
01:11:10,990 --> 01:11:13,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Hindi po yan ang realidad ng ordinaryong Pilipino.

715
01:11:13,990 --> 01:11:17,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Napakarami po sa ating mga kababayan ang umaasa sa public transport.

716
01:11:17,990 --> 01:11:21,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Para makapasok sa trabaho at makauwi sa kanilang mga tahanan.

717
01:11:21,990 --> 01:11:25,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: I hope that Congress through this committee will not take this budget cut lightly.

718
01:11:25,990 --> 01:11:29,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And act to firmly restore the EDSA Carousel budget.

719
01:11:29,990 --> 01:11:32,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And kasama niyo po kami para tiyakin po ito.

720
01:11:32,990 --> 01:11:36,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Punta naman po tayo dito sa Public Transport Modernization Program.

721
01:11:36,990 --> 01:11:44,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sinabi na ating sekretary sa isang presko na kailangan tulungan ng gobyerno ang mga transport groups na nag-qualify na sa modernization program.

722
01:11:44,990 --> 01:11:46,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Dahil marami sa kanila ang hirap.

723
01:11:46,990 --> 01:11:50,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Na nabayaran ang amortization ng kanilang modern units.

724
01:11:50,990 --> 01:11:56,990
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: May datos po ba tayo kung ilan na ang nag-default o nasa panganib na mag-default sa kanilang payments?

725
01:11:56,990 --> 01:11:58,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Mr. Chair, if I may.

726
01:11:58,990 --> 01:12:04,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Before I defer to our sector ASEC on this topic.

727
01:12:04,990 --> 01:12:07,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I just want to inform this committee also.

728
01:12:07,990 --> 01:12:09,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama po kayo.

729
01:12:09,990 --> 01:12:13,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Nung nakaraan, I think it was like last month only po, Mr. Chair.

730
01:12:13,990 --> 01:12:15,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: We did this, kumbaga nag-pivot kami.

731
01:12:15,990 --> 01:12:17,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pivot kami sa PTMP.

732
01:12:17,990 --> 01:12:22,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Dati-rati ho, ang PTMP ay for equity subsidy lamang.

733
01:12:22,990 --> 01:12:27,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero because of the oil crisis, minabuti po natin na baguhin yung pulisiya.

734
01:12:27,990 --> 01:12:33,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ngayon po, 1.5 billion ang nilaan natin, ibibigay natin sa LTFRB.

735
01:12:33,990 --> 01:12:44,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: For the main reason po na ang purpose nito, ang layunin nito, ay tulungan, bayaran yung mga ating sabi nating enrolled PUVMP drivers, operators.

736
01:12:44,990 --> 01:12:46,990
