01:29:05,170 --> 01:29:06,110
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: San Fernando.

1171
01:29:06,970 --> 01:29:09,410
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Chair, bago po

1172
01:29:09,410 --> 01:29:10,810
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: pumatak yung oras ko,

1173
01:29:11,470 --> 01:29:13,090
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: gusto ko lang po itanong, nandito po ba yung

1174
01:29:13,130 --> 01:29:14,750
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: general manager ng MRT-3?

1175
01:29:17,020 --> 01:29:18,420
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Mr. Chair, if I may,

1176
01:29:18,600 --> 01:29:20,800
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I received an information po,

1177
01:29:20,860 --> 01:29:22,440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: naka-medical leave,

1178
01:29:22,740 --> 01:29:24,120
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: and I asked specifically

1179
01:29:24,120 --> 01:29:26,160
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: kung ano nangyari sa kanya.

1180
01:29:26,340 --> 01:29:28,320
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Baka po ko sinipo, sadyang natakot.

1181
01:29:28,660 --> 01:29:29,480
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang sabi is,

1182
01:29:30,400 --> 01:29:32,060
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: cardio, eco-cardio,

1183
01:29:32,120 --> 01:29:33,820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: pero, can I, ano,

1184
01:29:34,260 --> 01:29:36,280
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I'll get the exact na kung anong ginagawa

1185
01:29:36,280 --> 01:29:37,680
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: sa kanya ngayon,

1186
01:29:38,000 --> 01:29:40,400
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: but it's something about eco-cardiogram,

1187
01:29:41,000 --> 01:29:42,280
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: but something about heart, siguro.

1188
01:29:42,280 --> 01:29:43,480
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Baka po, ano.

1189
01:29:44,440 --> 01:29:45,880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Chair, gusto ko lang po i-point out,

1190
01:29:45,980 --> 01:29:48,340
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: kasi, nung nakaraan, nagtago na naman yan eh,

1191
01:29:48,940 --> 01:29:50,920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yung General Manager ng MRP3.

1192
01:29:51,740 --> 01:29:53,080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At ngayon, wala na naman.

1193
01:29:54,220 --> 01:29:55,300
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Itinaon yung kanyang

1194
01:29:55,300 --> 01:29:56,880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: general check-up kung kailan

1195
01:29:56,880 --> 01:29:59,000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sumasalang yung budget ng DOTR.

1196
01:29:59,380 --> 01:30:00,040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Anyway, Mr. Chair,

1197
01:30:00,140 --> 01:30:01,240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: I'll proceed with my question.

1198
01:30:01,800 --> 01:30:05,700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kaya ako po natanong kung nandito ba ang general manager ng MRT-3.

1199
01:30:06,680 --> 01:30:12,440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kasi po noong February 3, 2026, kami po ay nagsumiti ng letter sa inyong opisina.

1200
01:30:13,240 --> 01:30:18,400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: We are raising serious safety and labor concerns.

1201
01:30:19,500 --> 01:30:26,100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yung sa safety concern, Mr. Chair, pumapatungkol po ito sa pag-bypass ng automatic train protection

1202
01:30:26,100 --> 01:30:28,980
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng MRT-3 sa North Turnback.

1203
01:30:28,980 --> 01:30:36,820
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At sinasabi namin dito, Mr. Chair, na pupwedeng compromise ang safety ng mga four-car trains

1204
01:30:36,820 --> 01:30:39,880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na nagpa-fly-through dyan sa MRT-3.

1205
01:30:40,360 --> 01:30:47,840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ngayon, Mr. Chair, sa halip na sagutin ito ng general manager ng MRT-3,

1206
01:30:48,580 --> 01:30:54,660
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: noong March 17, gumawa na ng mga retaliatory actions yung general manager ng MRT-3.

1207
01:30:54,660 --> 01:30:58,620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At nagre-reklamo po mga engineer, mga operator ng train,

1208
01:30:58,980 --> 01:31:00,300
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: mga expert po ng mga manager.

1209
01:31:00,320 --> 01:31:08,740
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Instead of addressing these concerns, pinagtatanggal ni general manager kapati yung mga manggagawa na yan.

1210
01:31:09,280 --> 01:31:12,260
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And in fact, sumagot sila, Mr. Chair, sa ating opisina.

1211
01:31:13,060 --> 01:31:16,580
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero yung sagot nila, syempre, kung ang gusto naming paimbestigaan ng MRT-3,

1212
01:31:17,180 --> 01:31:19,660
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: syempre, sasabihin ng MRT-3, safe naman yung mga train.

1213
01:31:20,280 --> 01:31:26,340
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And that is why we requested, Mr. Chair, for the OTR to come in and to investigate the matter.

1214
01:31:26,340 --> 01:31:29,200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Now, Mr. Chair, if I may recall,

1215
01:31:30,320 --> 01:31:36,100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: During one of the lead committee hearings, nirace ko na po ito kay Secretary Banoy.

1216
01:31:36,680 --> 01:31:39,500
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Alam niyo po, napakabastos niyang general manager na yan eh.

1217
01:31:40,200 --> 01:31:44,940
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kasi sinabi, wala siyang pakialam kahit congressman pa ang mag-iimbestiga sa kanya

1218
01:31:44,940 --> 01:31:49,840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: dahil napakalakas niya kay Pangulong Bongbong Marcos at sa sekretary ng DOTR.

1219
01:31:50,320 --> 01:31:53,720
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Now it has been seven months since we submitted this letter

1220
01:31:53,720 --> 01:31:58,160
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: and five months since sinabi niyo po, Secretary Banoy, na iimbestiga niyo yung matter.

1221
01:31:58,160 --> 01:32:00,600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ano na po ang update dito, Secretary Banoy?

1222
01:32:01,400 --> 01:32:04,840
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Just for update po, let me just differentiate two matters.

1223
01:32:05,000 --> 01:32:06,520
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: First on the safety issue.

1224
01:32:07,700 --> 01:32:11,160
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Para lang po mapanatag din ang ating mga mananakay.

1225
01:32:11,600 --> 01:32:16,260
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung safety issue po na sinasabi po ng mga dating empleyado ng MRT-3

1226
01:32:16,260 --> 01:32:21,500
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: were already belied by no other than three experts, foreign experts po.

1227
01:32:21,740 --> 01:32:26,720
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ito po yung Sumitomo, ito po yung Rylan, at saka meron pang misa eh.

1228
01:32:27,220 --> 01:32:27,820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Sistra.

1229
01:32:27,820 --> 01:32:29,520
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ito po yung talagang dalubhasa.

1230
01:32:30,160 --> 01:32:32,920
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At sinabi nila, walang ganitong safety issue.

1231
01:32:33,460 --> 01:32:36,680
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At is para lang mapanatag po ang ating motorista.

1232
01:32:37,220 --> 01:32:41,260
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi ang pagsasabi na hindi po ligtas ang ating riles,

1233
01:32:41,840 --> 01:32:45,900
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ay wala po yung ano, hindi po parang sinasabi na rin natin.

1234
01:32:45,980 --> 01:32:48,000
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: It's like a bump joke po sa evasion.

1235
01:32:48,740 --> 01:32:49,760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Napakadelikado po niyan.

1236
01:32:50,560 --> 01:32:55,600
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Especially now that sumasakay po ang karamihan sa ating riles.

1237
01:32:55,600 --> 01:32:57,440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Imagine 500,000.

1238
01:32:57,820 --> 01:32:59,500
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Daily passengers po, no?

1239
01:32:59,740 --> 01:33:00,540
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: On the average.

1240
01:33:00,800 --> 01:33:02,640
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At sasabihin po natin hindi ligtas.

1241
01:33:03,180 --> 01:33:05,320
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: That is quite irresponsible.

1242
01:33:06,560 --> 01:33:07,480
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung sinasabi ko.

1243
01:33:07,540 --> 01:33:13,300
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At least po, I have to be very, kumbaga, sorry po, for lack of better term.

1244
01:33:13,540 --> 01:33:15,440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I have to face this head on.

1245
01:33:15,500 --> 01:33:16,800
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: On the safety issue po.

1246
01:33:17,120 --> 01:33:20,500
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Not for the OTR, but more for the commuters po.

1247
01:33:20,760 --> 01:33:25,640
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Again, under pain of being redundant, may hindi na po the OTR ang magsasabi ho.

1248
01:33:25,640 --> 01:33:27,580
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Baka sabihin natin self-service.

1249
01:33:27,820 --> 01:33:30,940
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: May tatlo pong dalubhasa, banyaga ho.

1250
01:33:31,500 --> 01:33:34,700
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Na ang ginawa lang sa buong buhay nila, mag-aral po ng riles.

1251
01:33:35,420 --> 01:33:37,480
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Sumitomo, Rylan, at sa kasistra.

1252
01:33:37,800 --> 01:33:39,820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Sinasabi ho, ligtas.

1253
01:33:40,700 --> 01:33:42,940
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At least po, okay na po tayo sa aspetong yan.

1254
01:33:43,260 --> 01:33:47,460
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pagdating naman po kay GM Mike Kapati, tama po kayo.

1255
01:33:48,000 --> 01:33:51,560
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ito po ay binigay ko sa Isles, yung ating departemento.

1256
01:33:52,220 --> 01:33:54,480
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ininvestigan na po si GM Mike Kapati.

1257
01:33:54,480 --> 01:33:56,940
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At hindi po po nagtatapos dyan.

1258
01:33:57,100 --> 01:33:57,780
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Alam ko po.

1259
01:33:57,780 --> 01:34:00,560
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: May kaso sa Civil Service Commission.

1260
01:34:01,080 --> 01:34:05,500
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasama yung I think mga iba't iba't empleyado ng MRT3.

1261
01:34:05,980 --> 01:34:07,640
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And I can assure this committee po.

1262
01:34:07,940 --> 01:34:11,780
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kapag lumabas man sa resolusyon ng Civil Service Commission

1263
01:34:11,780 --> 01:34:15,440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: that they violated some label provisions po.

1264
01:34:15,860 --> 01:34:20,620
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pagdating dito, makakaasa po kayo kung ano man yung iutos ng commission,

1265
01:34:21,060 --> 01:34:22,580
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I'm going to implement it po.

1266
01:34:22,580 --> 01:34:27,560
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And I'm going to furnish a copy to this committee of what we have done.

1267
01:34:27,780 --> 01:34:30,540
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: In the event po na mayroon na pong resolusyon.

1268
01:34:30,540 --> 01:34:33,020
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So I'm going to defer po to the wisdom of the commission.

1269
01:34:33,320 --> 01:34:34,540
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi andyan na po yung kaso.

1270
01:34:34,880 --> 01:34:36,440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama po, lahat po tayo gobyerno.

1271
01:34:36,740 --> 01:34:39,780
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang talagang ahawak po dyan is the Civil Service Commission.

1272
01:34:40,320 --> 01:34:42,640
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kung mayroong kailangan sa habi ng Civil Service Commission,

1273
01:34:43,160 --> 01:34:45,140
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: lahat po ay binibigay po ng aming legal.

1274
01:34:45,660 --> 01:34:49,140
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang makakaasa po kayo na walang whitewash dito at wala din pong cover up.

1275
01:34:49,340 --> 01:34:50,840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Mr. Secretary.

1276
01:34:51,440 --> 01:34:55,100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: But it has been five months po since the lead committee meeting

1277
01:34:55,100 --> 01:34:57,620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: where you said that the Isles will invest in the civil service.

1278
01:34:57,780 --> 01:35:02,260
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: I would like to ask po, ano na po ba yung status doon sa Isles?

1279
01:35:03,240 --> 01:35:05,820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: There are initial findings na po.

1280
01:35:06,820 --> 01:35:13,440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang sinabi niyo sa mga sulat niyo po kasi kagalang-galang na congressman,

1281
01:35:13,540 --> 01:35:17,380
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: yung issue po kasi ng safety and my kapati.

1282
01:35:18,380 --> 01:35:20,180
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So yun po yung dalawang issue.

1283
01:35:20,760 --> 01:35:22,720
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So kailangan yung dalawa ding issue na yun,

1284
01:35:22,960 --> 01:35:24,220
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ang binigay ko sa Isles.

1285
01:35:24,620 --> 01:35:26,100
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Not pratingnan nila.

1286
01:35:26,240 --> 01:35:27,740
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So ito po yung talagang...

1287
01:35:27,740 --> 01:35:29,620
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ito po yung talagang malawakan at malalim.

1288
01:35:29,700 --> 01:35:31,580
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kung issue lang po sana ni my kapati,

1289
01:35:31,920 --> 01:35:33,380
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: baka mas mabilis pa tayo.

1290
01:35:33,680 --> 01:35:35,600
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero sabi ko nga, may kaso sa civil service.

1291
01:35:35,640 --> 01:35:36,740
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: There's initial finding na po.

1292
01:35:36,820 --> 01:35:37,900
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Nawala sa OSEC pa po, no?

1293
01:35:38,220 --> 01:35:41,080
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So meron po naman kasing not protocol,

1294
01:35:41,460 --> 01:35:42,560
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: pero yan po ay dadaan pa.

1295
01:35:43,060 --> 01:35:47,420
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Isles, legal, at rain, USEC.

1296
01:35:48,200 --> 01:35:52,200
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I have to admit, nakita ko po yung initial findings,

1297
01:35:52,380 --> 01:35:54,780
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: deliberation po ng ating Isles.

1298
01:35:54,780 --> 01:35:55,780
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: But I think the more prudent...

1299
01:35:55,780 --> 01:35:57,700
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: But I think the more prudent...

1300
01:35:57,700 --> 01:35:59,180
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: The more prudent recourse for me,

1301
01:35:59,640 --> 01:36:01,140
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: since initial pa lang po yun,

1302
01:36:01,240 --> 01:36:02,780
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: it's not a final determination,

1303
01:36:03,500 --> 01:36:06,120
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ay hindi ko po muna masasabi kung ano yung findings sila.

1304
01:36:06,380 --> 01:36:08,360
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: But at least I have to address already

1305
01:36:08,360 --> 01:36:10,420
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: the issue of the safety po.

1306
01:36:10,500 --> 01:36:12,020
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yun po kasi importante sa amin.

1307
01:36:12,440 --> 01:36:12,880
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Thank you po.

1308
01:36:13,120 --> 01:36:14,860
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Secretary.

1309
01:36:15,380 --> 01:36:16,900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kaya ako po nire-raise itong issue na to

1310
01:36:16,900 --> 01:36:18,940
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: dahil kanina napag-uusapan na po natin

1311
01:36:18,940 --> 01:36:22,220
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yung additional na mga station for the MRT operation.

1312
01:36:22,940 --> 01:36:24,820
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At uulitin ko po, Mr. Chair,

1313
01:36:25,820 --> 01:36:26,640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: hindi po ako papayag,

1314
01:36:26,640 --> 01:36:27,680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: hahabulin ko talaga yan.

